# Root build context for the three service Dockerfiles. Every Dockerfile is
# built with the repository root as its context, so this single file keeps
# bin/, obj/, secrets, evidence and reports out of every image.

# Build output and caches (never in an image)
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
*.user
*.suo

# Node tooling for the ABP LeptonX theme (Order Service). The flash-sale APIs
# need none of it, and wwwroot/libs is git-ignored (populated by
# `abp install-libs`). Excluded so the build context stays small.
**/node_modules/
**/wwwroot/libs/

# Version control and agent-local files
.git/
.agent-tasks/
.claude/
.groundwork/

# Secrets and local configuration -- never baked into an image
**/appsettings.secrets.json
*.pfx
.env
.env.*
*.env

# Evidence, reports and logs
tests/evidence/
tests/**/results/
report/
**/Logs/
**/*.log
